hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3025","**\nNarrated to us Yunus ibn ‘Abd al-A‘la, who said: Ashhab informed us, that al-Layth informed him, that Abu’l-Zubayr informed him, that Jabir (RA) narrated:\n\nThat the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) granted ‘A’ishah (RA) the concession of entering the state of ihram for ‘umrah from at-Tan‘im during Dhu’l-Hijjah."
"3026","**\nNarrated to us Yunus, he said: 'Abdullah ibn Wahb informed us, he said: al-Layth informed me, that Abu az-Zubayr informed him, from Jabir ibn 'Abdullah (RA), that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) granted 'A'ishah (RA) the concession to perform 'umrah from at-Tan'im on the night of al-Hasbah during the year of the Farewell Pilgrimage (Hajjat al-Wida')."
